ung Galaxy A15 5G (6.5")&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;High-quality, rotatable clip,easily attaches to belt, waistband or purse. Holster clip swivels and has sturdy locking mechanism.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Rubberized textured case adds protection and makes gripping your phone easy. Provides scratch and drop protection. Foldable kickstand for convenient multimedia viewing.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;IMPORTANT NOTE: This only fits Samsung Galaxy A16 5G (6.7").&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Precisely cut to preserve full use of volume buttons, charger, camera, microphone, headphone jack, and all other ports.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Your phone can easily be removed from holster without removing it from the case.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;br&gt; &lt;br&gt; &lt;div class="box"&gt; &lt;div class="title"&gt; &lt;i class="fa fa-plane"&gt;&lt;/i&gt; Shipping &lt;/div&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;ul&gt; &lt;li&gt;We ship ALL in-stock orders on the same day or the next business day after cleared payment received. We do not ship on weekends or holidays.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;US and CANADA only.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;For other international locations please contact us to get a shipping quote.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;When your shipment is confirmed, you will receive a shipment confirmation e-mail.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Domestic Orders: Items will be shipped via USPS First Class Mail or Parcel Post Transit time is approximately 2-7 business days.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;International Orders: Items will be shipped via USPS First Class International Mail, Transit time is approximately 7-25 business days.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt; &lt;/p&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;br&gt; &lt;div class="box"&gt; &lt;div class="title"&gt; &lt;i class="fa fa-refresh"&gt;&lt;/i&gt; Returns &lt;/div&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;ul&gt; &lt;li&gt;Please use "Contact Seller" link in your account or click &lt;a href="${store.contactUsUrl}" target="_blank"&gt;Contact us&lt;/a&gt; link to send us an email.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Customers are responsible for determin